# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of AI skills for Qiskit quantum computing workflows."
msgstr "Přehled dovedností AI pro pracovní postupy kvantového počítání s Qiskit."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills"
msgstr "Dovednosti AI pro Qiskit"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills {#qiskit-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Dovednosti AI pro Qiskit {#qiskit-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Qiskit AI skills repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) has a set of skills that you can use with AI assistants, such as Bob, Claude, or ChatGPT. An AI skill is a reusable set of instructions that teaches the assistant how to complete a specific task.  Skills can help save time and ensure that repeatable tasks are done consistently and correctly.  \n"
msgstr "[Repozitář dovedností AI pro Qiskit](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) obsahuje sadu dovedností, které můžeš použít s AI asistenty, jako je Bob, Claude nebo ChatGPT. Dovednost AI je opakovaně použitelná sada instrukcí, která asistenta naučí, jak provést konkrétní úkol. Dovednosti mohou pomoci ušetřit čas a zajistit, že opakující se úkoly jsou prováděny konzistentně a správně.  \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a Qiskit AI skill, follow the instructions for your AI assistant.  In general, you just need to give the skill to the assistant, then tell it where to apply the skill.\n"
msgstr "Chceš-li použít dovednost AI pro Qiskit, postupuj podle instrukcí pro svého AI asistenta. Obecně stačí dovednost asistentovi předat a poté mu říct, kde ji má použít.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation {#installation}"
msgstr "Instalace {#installation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These skills follow the [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) standard and can\n"
"be installed into compatible AI coding agents using the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), through\n"
"native agent plugin marketplaces, or by cloning the repository.\n"
msgstr "Tyto skills (dovednosti) odpovídají standardu [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) a lze je nainstalovat do kompatibilních AI kódovacích agentů pomocí [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), prostřednictvím nativních marketplace pluginů agentů nebo naklonováním repozitáře.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start {#quick-start}"
msgstr "Rychlý start {#quick-start}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The easiest way to install is with the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills):\n"
msgstr "Nejjednodušší způsob instalace je pomocí [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills):\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This will prompt you to pick which agent(s) to install for and whether to install globally or just for the current project.\n"
msgstr "Budeš vyzván, pro kterého agenta (nebo které agenty) chceš instalovat a zda globálně, nebo jen pro aktuální projekt.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Install a specific skill:**\n"
msgstr "**Instalace konkrétní skill:**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Keep installed skills current:**\n"
msgstr "**Udržování nainstalovaných skills aktuálních:**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install as a plugin {#install-as-a-plugin}"
msgstr "Instalace jako plugin {#install-as-a-plugin}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Claude Code {#claude-code}"
msgstr "Claude Code {#claude-code}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install using the [plugin marketplace](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"
msgstr "Instaluj pomocí [plugin marketplace](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Codex {#codex}"
msgstr "Codex {#codex}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cursor {#cursor}"
msgstr "Cursor {#cursor}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from the Cursor marketplace if available, or use the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent cursor`. See [Cursor plugins docs](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Instaluj z marketplace Cursoru, pokud je dostupný, nebo použij výše uvedené [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) s `--agent cursor`. Další informace najdeš v [dokumentaci pluginů Cursoru](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins).\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"
msgstr "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bob has no plugin/marketplace step — it reads `SKILL.md` files directly from `.bob/skills/` in a cloned project. The repository symlinks the skills to `.bob/skills/<name>`  so cloning the repo is sufficient.\n"
msgstr "Bob nemá krok s pluginem/marketplace — čte soubory `SKILL.md` přímo z `.bob/skills/` v naklonovaném projektu. Repozitář odkazuje na skills symbolickými odkazy v `.bob/skills/<name>`, takže stačí repozitář naklonovat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install with the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent bob`.\n"
msgstr "Můžeš také instalovat pomocí výše uvedeného [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) s `--agent bob`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone / Copy {#clone--copy}"
msgstr "Klonování / kopírování {#clone--copy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your agent does not support a native plugin or the skills CLI, clone this repo and copy the desired skill directory to the agent's supported skill directory:\n"
msgstr "Pokud tvůj agent nepodporuje nativní plugin ani skills CLI, naklonuj tento repozitář a zkopíruj požadovaný adresář skill do adresáře skills, který agent podporuje:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Agent | Skill Directory | Docs |\n"
"|-------|-----------------| ----- |\n"
"| Claude Code | `~/.claude/skills/` | [docs](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills)\n"
"| Codex | `~/.codex/skills/` | [docs](https://developers.openai.com/codex/skills)\n"
"| Cursor | `~/.cursor/skills/` | [docs](https://cursor.com/docs/context/skills)\n"
"| IBM Bob | `.bob/skills/` | [docs](https://bob.ibm.com/docs/ide/features/skills)\n"
msgstr ""
